      "locator": "page 11, section: statement_of_basis",
      "exact_span": "Numeric criteria for Total Residual Chlorine are 19 micrograms per Liter (µg/L) at the point of discharge for Acute Aquatic Life designated uses and 11 ug/L for Wildlife Habitat and Chronic Aquatic Life Designated Uses.",
