      "source": "aztec/statement_of_basis.pdf",
      "locator": "page 11, section: statement_of_basis",
      "exact_span": "For existing industrial facilities, permitting authority may permit the salt discharge upon satisfactory demonstration that it meets one of three tests. The applicable test for the Aztec plant is that the existing tonnage of salt is less than one-ton (2000 lbs) per day or 366 tons per year.",
